    "ROB_HUNK_BODY_PRIMARY_CQC_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Praedatio.</style> <style=cIsDamage>Bis calce feri</style> pro <style=cIsDamage>200% et 250% damni</style>. Si <style=cIsUtility>secunda calx</style> tangit, cum <style=cIsDamage>Contraimpetu</style> sequere.",
